Subject: [PATCH] plugins/screenshot: Capture both eyes according to output
 mode

Expose stereoOutput independently of paired content. Capture ordinary windows with both eyes on composing outputs and assemble paired workspaces, duplicating mono output views. Keep 2D-only replies and the legacy strip helper unchanged.

